Need revenue drivers in the newest filing.I've finished the research and am writing the brief: five changes, each tied to an explanation in the filing. I left deferred revenue out because the filing only defines it and gives no reason for its growth.

The cash-flow and capital-spending explanations come from the filing's six-month discussion, since it gives no reason for these two figures for the quarter alone. Those passages contain no numbers in the claims, but they explain the half year rather than the quarter.

