": "Capital expenditures were $124.4 million in the quarter, compared with $30.5 million a year earlier. For the first half of the year, the filing lists purchases of property and equipment as a major investing outflow, alongside the Seraphic and SGNL acquisitions.", "passage_id": "CRWD-0001535527-26-000031:1780", "numbers": [{"metric": "capex", "field": "current", "value": 124413000}, {"metric": "capex", "field": "year_ago", "value": 30497000}]}]}
